<kml xmlns="http://www.opengis.net/kml/2.2"><Document><name>Spokane River Boating Zones (DRAFT) — 2026-10-19</name><open>1</open><description>Post Falls Dam to Lake Coeur d'Alene · Kootenai County, Idaho. Current rules: no wake within 100 ft · no towing within 150 ft · surf guideline 200 ft (from shore and docks) · lanes 3,000 ft. Of 666 acres: tow zone 271 ac, of which 174 ac also meet the 200-ft surf guideline; 3 straight lanes of 3,000 ft or more. No towing anywhere from 1 h after sunset to 1 h before sunrise (Idaho Code § 67-7024(1)–(3), (6)). Draft for review — not yet adopted · map draft 1 · rules as of 2026-10-18 · built 2026-10-19 · depths at summer full pool (2,128 ft). Screening map, not a navigation chart or legal determination. Posted buoys, signs and officers govern. A dock, boom or swim float missing from our data still counts — keep 100 ft (no wake) and 150 ft (no towing). Rules about swimmers, divers and moving boats can't be mapped — keep the required distance from anyone you see. Setbacks are measured from the summer full-pool shoreline; the law measures from today's waterline, so at low water the lines sit further out. Zone boundaries are approximate (not yet surveyed). Made by Cole Van Hersett for Hayden Lake Watershed Improvement District (HLWID) review Interactive map: https://colevh2112.github.io/spokane-river-boating/</description><Style id="s_zone_no_wake"><LineStyle><color>f230168a</color><width>2</width></LineStyle><PolyStyle><color>7330168a</color><fill>1</fill><outline>1</outline></PolyStyle></Style><Style id="s_zone_no_motor"><LineStyle><color>f25b18c2</color><width>2</width></LineStyle><PolyStyle><color>805b18c2</color><fill>1</fill><outline>1</outline></PolyStyle></Style><Style id="s_zone_no_entry"><LineStyle><color>f2111111</color><width>2</width></LineStyle><PolyStyle><color>99111111</color><fill>1</fill><outline>1</outline></PolyStyle></Style><Style id="s_idle"><LineStyle><color>f24a36e8</color><width>1.2</width></LineStyle><PolyStyle><color>734a36e8</color><fill>1</fill><outline>1</outline></PolyStyle></Style><Style id="s_cruise"><LineStyle><color>f22491ff</color><width>1.2</width></LineStyle><PolyStyle><color>732491ff</color><fill>1</fill><outline>1</outline></PolyStyle></Style><Style id="s_tow"><LineStyle><color>f23bd8ff</color><width>1.2</width></LineStyle><PolyStyle><color>803bd8ff</color><fill>1</fill><outline>1</outline></PolyStyle></Style><Style id="s_surf"><LineStyle><color>f2e8557d</color><width>1.2</width></LineStyle><PolyStyle><color>80e8557d</color><fill>1</fill><outline>1</outline></PolyStyle></Style><Style id="s_runs"><LineStyle><color>f2f5d319</color><width>3</width></LineStyle><PolyStyle><color>40f5d319</color><fill>1</fill><outline>1</outline></PolyStyle></Style><Style id="s_nwz"><LineStyle><color>f230168a</color><width>1.2</width></LineStyle><PolyStyle><color>7330168a</color><fill>1</fill><outline>1</outline></PolyStyle></Style><Style id="s_line_wake"><LineStyle><color>ff2491ff</color><width>2.5</width></LineStyle><PolyStyle><color>00000000</color><fill>0</fill><outline>1</outline></PolyStyle></Style><Style id="s_line_tow"><LineStyle><color>ff3bd8ff</color><width>2.5</width></LineStyle><PolyStyle><color>00000000</color><fill>0</fill><outline>1</outline></PolyStyle></Style><Style id="s_line_surf"><LineStyle><color>ffe8557d</color><width>2.5</width></LineStyle><PolyStyle><color>00000000</color><fill>0</fill><outline>1</outline></PolyStyle></Style><Style id="s_longest"><LineStyle><color>ff000000</color><width>3</width></LineStyle><PolyStyle><color>00000000</color><fill>0</fill><outline>1</outline></PolyStyle></Style><Style id="p_dam"><IconStyle><color>ff1c1cb7</color><scale>0.9</scale><Icon><href>http://maps.google.com/mapfiles/kml/shapes/forbidden.png</href></Icon></IconStyle><LabelStyle><scale>0.8</scale></LabelStyle><LineStyle><color>ff1c1cb7</color><width>3</width></LineStyle><PolyStyle><color>4d1c1cb7</color></PolyStyle></Style><Style id="p_bridge"><IconStyle><color>ff9e9